# By default Vercel bundles the entire repo into every serverless
# function's deployment package. The api/ Flask app (see api/index.py)
# needs nothing outside api/ and the root requirements.txt at runtime --
# everything below is either GitHub Pages/pipeline/analysis content that
# has nothing to do with the dashboard, or would just bloat the function
# for no reason.
#
# docs/pages/ alone is ~258MB (the GitHub Pages catalog viewer's page
# images) and was the actual cause of the first deploy's "Total bundle
# size (328.10 MB) exceeds the maximum function size (225 MB)" failure --
# none of it is imported by api/index.py or api/queries.py.
docs/
pipeline/
analysis/
dialectic/
scripts/
supabase/
